.el .ds Aq '
.TH QUIPU-IMPORT-REVIEW-NOTIFY 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-import\-review\-notify \- Report staged shares older than an age threshold to a route
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu import review notify\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-after\fR] [\fB\-\-limit\fR] [\fB\-\-age\-seconds\fR] [\fB\-\-route\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Report staged shares older than an age threshold to a route
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-after\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Resume after this cursor
.TP
\fB\-\-limit\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Maximum number of results
.TP
\fB\-\-age\-seconds\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Minimum notification age in seconds
.TP
\fB\-\-route\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Notification route for pending imports
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
